{"turn_id": "d19-t2", "session_id": "d19", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "model_type", "text": "该论文提出一个深度神经模型（deep neural model），利用实体链接来改进细粒度实体类型分类。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-d31ec43506655415203bffe9"}, {"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-bee14e88c20dfa401e81466f"}]}, {"key": "input_features", "text": "该模型基于上下文（context）、实体提及字符串（mention string）以及通过实体链接从知识库（KB）获得的类型信息来进行预测。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-d31ec43506655415203bffe9"}, {"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-23d2fdeeb3e49fb0893362f3"}]}, {"key": "loss_and_noise", "text": "为缓解对弱标注训练数据的过拟合，论文使用一种 hinge loss 的变体（variant of the hinge loss），并在训练中引入噪声。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-bee14e88c20dfa401e81466f"}, {"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-23d2fdeeb3e49fb0893362f3"}]}, {"key": "noise_detail", "text": "在训练时，若实体链接算法把提及链接到人物实体，则在生成 KB 类型表示时加入一个不属于该实体的随机细粒度人物类型标签，以迫使模型仍从上下文推断类型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-3deeb7727365666f3b0b87a5"}]}, {"key": "results", "text": "在两个常用数据集上，该模型相较当时最优方法取得超过 5% 的绝对 strict accuracy 提升。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-d31ec43506655415203bffe9"}, {"paper_id": "1909.12079", "chunk_id": "c-23d2fdeeb3e49fb0893362f3"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d19-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
